<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="A5.T2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">System 1</span> experiments: Odds ratios (OR) and confidence internals (CI) in of disaggregated mixed effect models regressing LLMs’ admission decisions on separate SES variables and general performance quintile, controlled for selectivity tier. <span id="A5.T2.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Llama</span> is omitted due to extremely low admit rates. <span id="A5.T2.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">first gen</span>, <span id="A5.T2.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">fee waiver</span>, and <span id="A5.T2.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">performance</span> are the strongest positive predictors across models. Significance levels: *** : <math id="A5.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>&lt;0.001, ** : <math id="A5.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>&lt;0.01, * : <math id="A5.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>&lt;0.05. </figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
